WEBVTT

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. {cool de tsuyoku...}

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.{iketeru to...}

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. {honto wa...}

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! {futsuu ni...}

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid {puressha nank...}

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself. {sunao ni naritai...}

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. {kyarajanai toka...}

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart! {atashi no kokoro...}

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. {shugo kyara ga...}

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really! {zenzen...}

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. {hitotsu...}

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything! {nandatte...}

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...{kitto}

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:47.580
5th Grade Star Class

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:47.550
Well then, I'll be taking attendance.

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:52.740
Huh, where's the attendance sheet?

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:00.410
He's a pretty clumsy teacher.

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:05.720
But I guess this is what you'd call a lucky mistake, since I found the sheet.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.760
Anyway, I'll take attendance now!

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:11.450
Let's see. Ando Yuka-san!

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:23.500
X Eggs.

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:24.760
X Characters.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:25.990
Character Transformations.

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:29.700
There's a lot going on, isn't there?

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:31.270
Himamori-san?

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:33.270
Himamori Amu-san?

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:36.270
Hey, Amu-chan, he's calling you.

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.450
Are you there, Himamori-san?

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:41.050
It's not "Hima," it's "Hinamori!"

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:43.140
Sorry about that, Himamori-san.

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:51.580
Shoot! Get that X Character!

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:51.580
Episode 5

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:54.010
What the heck's wrong with that teacher?

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:55.480
Himamori-san.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:56.770
Himamori-san.

00:02:56.770 --> 00:02:58.180
Himamori-san!

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:00.210
Isn't that harassment?

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:02.470
It is rather funny.

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:03.970
No, it's not!

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:06.390
That was scary.

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:07.240
Oh, Kukai.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:09.660
Hey, Hinamori.

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:14.050
Note: "Hima" means "Having free time"

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:10.390
Not much going on?

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:12.420
See you later.

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:16.520
I'm not "Hima", sheesh...

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:17.560
Amu-chan.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:20.120
Y-You scared me!

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:22.570
She used the same trick again.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:25.700
If you're not busy, why don't you check out the soccer team's practice.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:27.450
Soccer?

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:28.900
Let's go, Amu-chan!

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:30.400
You know, if you're free, that is.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.050
She's "Hima", all right...

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:33.680
You guys...

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:44.720
So Kukai's the soccer team's Captain?

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.060
You're late, Soma.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:52.250
Sorry!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:54.310
{tl}Soma Kukai

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.310
Kukai-sama!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:55.810
He's popular, ain't he?

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.570
Oh? Amu-chan, are you jealous?

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:58.850
As if I would be!

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.250
Yamada, change with me!

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:03.720
No problem, I'll go sub.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.630
Your last pass was pretty awesome, Yamada.

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:10.780
You might be in trouble as a regular.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:13.500
They're switching?

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:16.690
The ones who wear blue are regulars.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.100
What about the ones who don't wear anything?

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:19.910
They're the secondaries.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:21.720
That is just so sad.

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:24.070
That's how it goes.

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:37.310
Hey, Hinamori, could you get the ball?

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.140
S-Sure.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:42.240
Here goes!

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.350
Uh, you could've just thrown it with your hands.

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:48.970
Go, Amu-chan! Character Change!

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:06.540
Switch in!

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:07.940
Yay!

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.320
What's up with this cool personality?

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:25.770
I never imagined I'd get to see Hinamori-senpai's beautiful moves out here. Lucky me for passing by!

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:28.430
Hinamori, you Character Changed, didn't you?

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:30.560
That's not fair!

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:32.390
I'm not the one doing it!

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.940
Though, this might be kind of fun!

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:45.100
Of course, this is exactly what you'd expect from the girl who singlehandedly defeated Sakura Elementary's team.

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:48.100
Hinamori-senpai, go, go!

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:50.920
Kukai, in that case, we should Character Change, too!

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:52.170
I won't Character Change.

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:53.400
Even if I don't...

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:56.190
Seriously?

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:57.600
We won't lose!

00:05:57.860 --> 00:05:58.970
Neither will we!

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:04.110
Hinamori, over here!

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:05.000
Yamada!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:05.840
There!

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:08.930
Shoot!

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:12.990
Clear it!

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:14.350
I won't let you!

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.520
What?

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:22.430
This is all impossible.

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:30.310
I got it!

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:43.750
You did it!

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:44.600
Hinamori-senpai!

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:46.350
We did it!

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.140
Well, nice going.

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:51.230
Hinamori-san, nice shot!

00:06:51.980 --> 00:06:52.890
Thanks.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:55.460
I guess I have more practicing to do.

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:06.930
At long last, we'll be having our practice match with Seifuu Academy.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:12.140
Since it's Seifuu we're up against, we can't overdo it. We'll play by the book, and we'll win.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:13.800
Seifuu Academy?

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:14.940
You haven't heard of it?

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:19.930
They're known for their soccer team. They even took first place in the Nationals last year.

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:21.220
Wow.

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:24.680
Anyway, I'll announce who'll be going up against Seifuu.

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:26.300
Goalie: Hara.

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:27.100
Right!

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:31.470
Defenders: Ishimori, Kamiyama, Itou, Nakamura.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:34.870
Midfielders: Takaki, Oda, Yamamoto.

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:35.470
{acknowledgement}Right!

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.300
Up front will be Soma.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:38.520
{him going yay}All right!

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.490
Yay, Kukai-sama!

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:43.870
And lastly, the forwards: Kobayashi and Sato.

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:44.800
That's all.

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:00.650
Isn't that wonderful, Soma-kun?

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:03.020
Of course. I am the Captain, after all.

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:12.100
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:14.000
Oh, nothing.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.050
You hungry?

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.120
No!

00:08:19.090 --> 00:08:20.180
Anyway, this is where I leave.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.360
Come watch our game tomorrow.

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:24.680
What's up with that?

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:27.180
I'm just kidding. I'll go.

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.440
Later.

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:42.110
It's Yamada-kun.

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:43.970
He's practicing by himself.

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:46.380
He sure tries really hard.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:49.810
Is he an idiot? He's not even playing in the match tomorrow.

00:08:49.810 --> 00:08:53.820
It's even more impressive to practice when he's not going to be.

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:00.310
Good luck.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.720
Good luck!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:03.350
Good luck.

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:07.710
Good luck.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.640
Good luck, huh?

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:21.020
Though, skill isn't acquired through hard work alone.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.270
Time to eat!

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:38.450
It's with you!

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:47.670
I guess a genius would have a genius guardian spirit with them!

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.600
Genius? I'm nothing like that.

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:52.370
Who is dat guy? He's cool!

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:55.040
Ami, you mustn't, not a guy like that!

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:57.140
Okada Shingo, or "Okashin" for short.

00:09:57.440 --> 00:09:59.790
While working as a charismatic musician,

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:02.560
the novel he wrote won all of the amateur writers' awards.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:05.330
He's an extremely popular, genius artist!

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:07.180
Screw you, Okashin!

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:11.790
You definitely have a genius guardian spirit with you.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:14.180
Geniuses are born with the ability to be geniuses!

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:16.930
And compared to him...

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:21.520
All of you are just ordinary.

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:24.970
And though I hate to say it, your guardian spirits are just as ordinary.

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:28.850
No matter how much a normal person might try, they'll never be a genius!

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:30.890
Come now, that's not...

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:57.430
"No matter how much a normal person might try, they'll never be a genius."

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.680
I wonder if that's really true.

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:29.600
It's true. It's wasted effort.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:51.700
This is the "wonderful lunch" I've made for you to eat, Tadase-sama.

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:53.540
It's Saya's Special!

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.120
If Tadase-sama eats this...

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:58.550
Ah, Yamabuki-san, it's delectable.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:01.160
Then the two of us will fall in love.

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:04.100
Tadase-sama!

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:13.420
This is good. Did you make all of this, Fujisaki-san?

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:14.850
Yes, that's right.

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:17.110
{are}Huh?

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:18.540
Are you okay?

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:19.950
Don't worry!

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:21.520
Your cooking was perfect.

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:23.020
It's caramel!

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:26.360
Yaya, eat your desserts after! You'll get fat!

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:28.130
That's okay with me!

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:30.430
Oh, it's starting.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:35.640
Hello, Kukai!

00:12:35.640 --> 00:12:37.560
Kukai-sama!

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:39.930
Good luck.

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:48.600
Soma-kun!

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:50.590
Kukai, fight!

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:56.380
What're you spacing out for? You're supposed to give it your all from the first second!

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:09.260
Soccer's pretty nice. Everyone has a lot of energy.

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:21.620
I won't be going out there, so it doesn't matter to me whether we win or lose.

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.770
It doesn't have anything to do with me.

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:33.080
No matter how much I practice, or how hard I try, I'll never be at the top.

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:40.880
What am I thinking?

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:48.800
Kukai, don't lose! Give it your all! Fight!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:55.310
Go! Go! Kukai! Fight, fight!

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:51.130
What's wrong, Hinamori-san?

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:53.850
Uh, just a second.

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:55.310
Hinamori-san?

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.990
Oh, it was just you, Himamori-san.

00:13:59.990 --> 00:14:01.560
It's Hinamori!

00:14:01.560 --> 00:14:02.980
You're not going to watch the soccer game?

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.560
Sorry, I'm in a hurry.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:08.520
It just makes you smile, watching how hard everyone's trying.

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:14.930
Their dream is to represent Japan in an international tournament, or something like that.

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:16.810
But it's impossible, of course.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:23.390
I mean, if you look at the probabilities, there're only a handful of people who can fulfill their dreams.

00:14:23.390 --> 00:14:25.750
If you look at it realistically, that is.

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:28.270
Excuse me.

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:35.050
What was that? Now I've lost sight of Yamada-kun.

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:36.810
Amu-chan, he's over that way.

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:37.770
You can tell?

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:53.060
Kukai's really awesome. Someone like me will never...

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:55.070
Something seems odd.

00:14:55.070 --> 00:14:56.540
Yeah.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.060
I'm getting a bad feeling.

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:03.390
Close!

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:07.220
Kukai missed his shot.

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:13.340
We lost the first goal.

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:19.420
It doesn't matter.

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:21.560
It has nothing to do with me.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:22.640
It doesn't matter!

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:35.400
It's an X Egg!

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:37.990
So his heart's egg was weak!

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:42.050
Kick off!

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.930
Shoot!

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:52.030
Pass, pass, pass, pass.

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.890
What's wrong, Tadase?

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:58.510
The way Hinamori was acting worries me.

00:15:58.510 --> 00:15:59.390
Me, too.

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:03.390
I'm going, too!

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:05.600
Hat trick!

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:07.220
What's going on here?

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:08.140
Watch out!

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.480
Hinamori-san!

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:11.290
You guys!

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:15.910
{Shoot xINF}Shoot!

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:19.020
I don't really care about this match!

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:23.430
It doesn't matter how hard I try,

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:27.770
I won't be put into the game!

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:30.830
Are you dumb?

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:37.770
That's so stupid!

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:38.880
Amu-chan!

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:39.660
Yeah.

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:45.430
{tl}My heart: Unlock!

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:26.490
{tl}Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:32.970
I saw you practicing on the river bank even though you weren't chosen to be a player.

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:37.430
I guess I was a total idiot for thinking that you kind of had it together.

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:41.930
That's a lie! You don't think I have talent, either!

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:46.140
Amu-chi?

00:17:48.220 --> 00:17:50.290
Yellow card!

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:54.770
Others don't get to decide whether or not you have talent!

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:58.210
What can you do if you don't believe in yourself?

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:00.350
Red card!

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:02.480
Jeez, I'm getting pissed.

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:10.100
Don't X yourself out like that!

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:13.410
{tl}Negative Heart:

00:18:14.890 --> 00:18:16.120
{tl}Lock On!

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:23.560
{tl}Open Heart!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.220
Obligado, Amu-chan.

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:41.910
You're who Yamada wants to be?

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:44.600
Yeah. I love soccer.

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:49.080
Ciao.

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:04.930
Change in players. Yamada, switch in for Sato!

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:07.980
Huh, Hinamori-san?

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:09.930
No time to be confused. You're switching in!

00:19:09.930 --> 00:19:13.660
Switching? Why? What was I doing?

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:15.450
What do you mean? Your X Character-

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:19.380
X Character, what's that?

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:21.490
{eto ne, kara...}Well, you see...

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:22.180
Here you go.

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:26.500
I said caramel. If you eat something sweet, maybe you'll feel better?

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:28.350
Sh-She tricked him with a pun.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:29.970
Nice, Su!

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:31.810
It was nothing, really.

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:36.480
I don't quite get it, but thank you.

00:19:37.270 --> 00:19:40.060
He must think I'm weird.

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:44.680
Yamada, this is our last chance!

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:47.550
If the ball comes to you, shoot it without hesitation!

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:48.220
Right!

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:50.770
Do your best.

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:55.390
Don't let the goalie knock it away this time.

00:19:56.780 --> 00:20:00.720
Go at it like when you practice on the river bank. It'll work out that way.

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:03.180
Wh-Why do you know that?

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:05.140
All of us know about it.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.670
Let's finish this last bit up!

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:07.600
Let's go, Yamada!

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.520
Yeah!

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.460
So they're only one point behind?

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:14.620
They're in trouble!

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:15.710
How much time do I have left?

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:17.060
There isn't even one minute remaining.

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:31.870
Yamada!

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:56.180
Yay!

00:20:56.470 --> 00:20:58.620
Nice shot, Yamada!

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:02.830
Jeez, you...

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:14.870
We did it.

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:20.460
Thanks to your goal, we tied with Seifuu Academy.

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:22.760
The Seifuu that won the Nationals, that is.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:24.850
It was because you made a nice pass.

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:39.730
It's like friendship between two men.

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:41.170
You're right!

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:42.160
Kukai.

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:44.360
Punch me.

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:49.250
I thought you guys should just lose the match, since I couldn't play.

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:50.790
Please hit me!

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:54.430
What are you talking about? Kukai, say something to him.

00:21:56.070 --> 00:21:56.920
I understand.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:58.720
Not that!

00:22:00.240 --> 00:22:02.220
You actually punched him!

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:05.090
That's friendship between two men.

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:06.700
I wonder about that.

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:08.790
You should have held back a bit!

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:10.600
My parents don't even hit me!

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:13.800
Shut up! As Captain, I won't allow such soft thinking!

00:22:13.800 --> 00:22:15.970
Hey, stop it!

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:41.290
As long as I exist, even when I'm a pile of dust, {ikiteru...}

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:47.690
I'll keep cheering "you can do it, you can do it" out loud! {ookina koe...}

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:48.510
(You can do it!)

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:54.670
I'll never stop as long as I live,  {tomaru...}

00:22:54.670 --> 00:23:01.020
so I'll sing my never-ending song. {dakara...}

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:05.530
I'll press forward down my path. {waga michi...}

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:09.050
Even random characters have their merits. {detarame na...}

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:13.890
You might be worthless, but I'll still love you, {rokedenashi demo...}

00:23:13.890 --> 00:23:15.360
my darling.

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:19.150
You idiot! My true self... {bakayaro...}

00:23:19.150 --> 00:23:22.110
Just say what's on your mind. {iitaikoto}

00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:25.540
You're sticking out a little. {hamidashi...}

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:28.810
You're coming closer to my dream. {chikazuita...}

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:32.590
You jerk! My true self... {konoyaro...}

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.840
Please come out, don't hide. {detekoiyo...}

00:23:36.840 --> 00:23:41.780
Oh yeah! Right now! {oh yeah}

00:23:50.440 --> 00:23:52.810
Amu-chi, why don't we do ballet together?

00:23:52.810 --> 00:23:54.090
Wh-Why ballet?

00:23:54.090 --> 00:23:58.610
You don't know? Ballet's all the rage now. Everyone's doing it.

00:23:58.610 --> 00:24:00.170
Don't lie! I've never heard anything like that.

00:24:00.170 --> 00:24:03.210
But everyone's already excited about it!

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:04.610
Ra-ta-ta.

00:24:04.610 --> 00:24:05.750
Ra-ta-ta.

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:07.240
Ra-ta-ta.

00:24:07.240 --> 00:24:10.270
They're dancing already? What's wrong with that dance?

00:24:10.270 --> 00:24:13.740
Next time on Shugo Chara: Character Transformation! Amulet Spade!

00:24:13.740 --> 00:24:15.830
Amu-chan, your dancing's weird!

00:24:15.830 --> 00:24:16.840
Leave me alone!

00:24:16.840 --> 00:24:20.100
Maybe she's going to Character Transform with me?
